Package: AKsf
Title: Alaska Fisheries Spatial Features
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jim", "Ianelli", email = "jim.ianelli@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Alaska fisheries mapping with simple features and composable
    'ggplot2' layers. Includes NOAA reporting areas, Alaska Department of Fish
    and Game groundfish statistical and registration areas, and documented
    reference geometry for North Pacific Fishery Management Council fishery
    management plans. Retains agency identifiers and data provenance and uses
    an Alaska Albers projection for mapping across the antimeridian.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jimianelli.github.io/AKsf/, https://github.com/jimianelli/AKsf
BugReports: https://github.com/jimianelli/AKsf/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: sf, ggplot2, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, jsonlite, roxygen2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
